{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28300","headline":"今皇帝陛下一诏徵兵不日功集河湟诸郡次第归降臣获覩圣功辄献歌咏 · 杜牧","name":"今皇帝陛下一诏徵兵不日功集河湟诸郡次第归降臣获覩圣功辄献歌咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捷书皆应睿谋期，十万曾无一镞遗。\n汉武慙夸朔方地，周宣休道太原师。\n威加塞外寒来早，恩入河源冻合迟。\n听取满城歌舞曲，凉州声韵喜参差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}